  "schema_consequence": {
    "add": ["coverage_tier (1|2|3)", "pack_status (full|partial|none)", "country_role (market|delivery_centre|entity_only)"],
    "why": "A Mauritius ops procedure (843 staff, delivery centre) and a Belgian CAO fiche are both 'country-scoped' but answer completely different questions. One country attribute alone conflates them; tier + role keeps them apart and lets answers carry a confidence caveat when pack_status is not 'full'."
